  "intraday_notes": [
    {
      "id": "note-279f753f0ae3",
      "replay_time": "2026-08-21 09:35:00 EDT",
      "text": "大K線開盤 看是大震盪還是開盤BO",
      "created_at": "2026-09-24T05:18:37.275643+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-24T05:18:37.275650+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-6544ec0c96f5",
      "replay_time": "2026-08-21 09:39:00 EDT",
      "text": "Short Limit 拿second leg\n兩根都沒有成交",
      "created_at": "2026-09-24T05:19:11.928213+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-24T05:19:43.921549+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-97451166d47a",
      "replay_time": "2026-08-21 09:49:00 EDT",
      "text": "這邊1m已經測前低，不那麼激進的Short limit\n等小結構看有沒有10點多反轉",
      "created_at": "2026-09-24T05:20:36.103221+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-24T05:20:36.103228+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-b932f23423ab",
      "replay_time": "2026-08-21 10:14:00 EDT",
      "text": "波幅幾乎拿到，可以用Long Limit賭反轉拿50%位置\nSL抓TR BO 1.5R",
      "created_at": "2026-09-24T05:22:21.892993+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-24T05:24:32.455343+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-a5cea4876263",
      "replay_time": "2026-08-21 10:34:00 EDT",
      "text": "多方不強有可能再破底 前低可以加倉\n波幅沒有很大應該可以拿到50%",
      "created_at": "2026-09-24T05:25:06.269820+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-24T05:26:06.962281+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-7b85c80df4b3",
      "replay_time": "2026-08-21 11:04:00 EDT",
      "text": "拿到50%位置 這邊多方轉強可以出1/2嘗試拿上1/3\n但是小心震盪12點反轉",
      "created_at": "2026-09-24T05:27:12.858946+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-24T05:27:12.858959+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-81da64855c59",
      "replay_time": "2026-08-21 11:28:00 EDT",
      "text": "空方拿1m TTR BO 失敗多方有機會second leg",
      "created_at": "2026-09-24T05:29:32.986268+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-24T05:29:32.986276+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-52d7e0dd5150",
      "replay_time": "2026-08-21 11:35:00 EDT",
      "text": "拿到上1/3全部離場等12點反轉\n下半場應該 進入半區震盪看反轉幅度",
      "created_at": "2026-09-24T05:30:02.813653+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-24T05:30:02.813662+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-80cb0fc67ce8",
      "replay_time": "2026-08-21 12:04:00 EDT",
      "text": "這邊多方有點太強E1要拿到50%有點難等E2 Shrot",
      "created_at": "2026-09-24T05:30:58.042834+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-24T05:30:58.042840+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-b2e7920df65f",
      "replay_time": "2026-08-21 13:10:00 EDT",
      "text": "半區有可能已經出來 前高Short limit",
